WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.838 --> 00:00:15.559
Roxy pulled Terrell aside.

2
00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:18.731
"Someone robbed a doll show," she whispered.

3
00:00:18.732 --> 00:00:20.402
"I'll be back soon!"

4
00:00:20.403 --> 00:00:22.302
"Good luck," Terrell said.

5
00:00:22.303 --> 00:00:27.553
"I'll tell Jack and Mara you had to run home for a minute."

6
00:00:27.554 --> 00:00:30.613
Roxy arrived at Metro City Convention Center.

7
00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:34.830
Detective Smith was talking to some people.

8
00:00:34.831 --> 00:00:36.580
He held a tiny coat.

9
00:00:36.581 --> 00:00:42.250
Roxy grinned. "That coat is too small for you, Detective."

10
00:00:42.251 --> 00:00:43.911
Detective Smith frowned.

11
00:00:43.912 --> 00:00:49.348
"Ha-ha, Rocket Girl. This coat belongs to a doll."

12
00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:52.536
"A very special doll," a man said.

13
00:00:52.537 --> 00:00:54.556
He wore a bright green suit.

14
00:00:54.557 --> 00:00:57.931
"I spent a lot of money on it. It's from Europe."

15
00:00:57.932 --> 00:01:04.131
"My dolls are more than a hundred years old," a woman said, wiping a tear from her eye.

16
00:01:04.132 --> 00:01:06.877
"And now they're gone!"

17
00:01:06.878 --> 00:01:10.936
"My dolls are gone too!" another person said.

18
00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:13.169
Detective Smith took out his notebook.

19
00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:15.856
"Did anyone see the thief?"

20
00:01:15.857 --> 00:01:18.286
The man in the green suit sniffed.

21
00:01:18.287 --> 00:01:22.070
"No. We were eating lunch in another room."

22
00:01:22.071 --> 00:01:27.578
The woman nodded. "I heard a loud crash, like glass being smashed.

23
00:01:27.579 --> 00:01:33.134
We ran in here, and . . ." She started to cry.

24
00:01:33.135 --> 00:01:35.137
The man patted her shoulder.

25
00:01:35.138 --> 00:01:39.442
"It's okay, Betty. Rocket Girl will save our dolls."

26
00:01:39.443 --> 00:01:41.968
He looked at Roxy. "Right?"

27
00:01:41.969 --> 00:01:47.312
"I'll do my best." Roxy couldn't believe how much these people liked their dolls!

28
00:01:47.313 --> 00:01:51.190
"I heard the thief," another woman said.

29
00:01:51.191 --> 00:01:54.708
"I was near the exit during the robbery.

30
00:01:54.709 --> 00:02:00.875
I heard someone say, 'I am bad, bad, bad!'"

31
00:02:00.876 --> 00:02:02.872
Detective Smith scratched his head.

32
00:02:02.873 --> 00:02:05.543
"I might know who the thief is.

33
00:02:05.544 --> 00:02:09.089
A performer named Chuck was at my nephew's birthday party.

34
00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:12.179
He had a large doll and was terrible.

35
00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:16.911
He said the same thing: 'I am bad, bad, bad.'"

36
00:02:16.912 --> 00:02:22.263
"If Chuck was terrible," Roxy said, "maybe he became a thief instead."

37
00:02:22.264 --> 00:02:24.058
"I have his business card."

38
00:02:24.059 --> 00:02:26.909
Detective Smith pulled the card from his pocket and looked at it.

39
00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:31.219
"He lives just around the corner. Let's go."

40
00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:37.915
Roxy and Detective Smith arrived at Chuck's apartment.

41
00:02:37.916 --> 00:02:40.382
The door was open, so they went in.

42
00:02:40.383 --> 00:02:42.858
"Chuck?" Detective Smith called.

43
00:02:42.859 --> 00:02:46.960
They heard a muffled voice.

44
00:02:46.961 --> 00:02:49.210
Roxy rushed to the closet and opened it.

45
00:02:49.211 --> 00:02:51.403
A man was tied up!

46
00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:55.554
Detective Smith quickly untied him.

47
00:02:55.555 --> 00:02:57.422
"Thank you!" Chuck said.

48
00:02:57.423 --> 00:02:58.559
"I'm so glad you're here.

49
00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:00.874
He's evil and out of control!"

50
00:03:00.875 --> 00:03:03.355
"Huh?" Roxy scratched her head.

51
00:03:03.356 --> 00:03:07.211
"We're here because we thought you robbed the doll show."

52
00:03:07.212 --> 00:03:08.730
Chuck shook his head.

53
00:03:08.731 --> 00:03:11.585
"I wouldn't do that. It was him!"

54
00:03:11.586 --> 00:03:14.054
"Who?" Detective Smith asked.

55
00:03:14.055 --> 00:03:16.812
"Who do you think?" Chuck said.

56
00:03:16.813 --> 00:03:20.354
"My doll Chuckles!"
